### 2. Define Allowed File Types & Update Validation
Find the validateAndSetFile function (around line 125). We will introduce a variable to easily control allowed extensions and remove the hardcoded CSV.
**Replace the beginning of validateAndSetFile with this:**
```javascript
  // NEW: Control allowed file types here. Currently only Excel.
  const ALLOWED_FILE_TYPES = [".xlsx", ".xls"]; 

  const validateAndSetFile = (selected) => {
    if (!selected) return;
    const fileName = selected.name.toLowerCase();
    const fileSize = selected.size;

    const isValidExt = ALLOWED_FILE_TYPES.some((ext) => fileName.endsWith(ext));

    if (!isValidExt) {
      showSnackBar(`Invalid file type! Only ${ALLOWED_FILE_TYPES.join(", ")} files are supported.`, "error");
      clearInput();
      return;
    }

```
